    ;   just those low bytes (little-endian), zero-extended; the TRUNC is its
    ;   register. A sole SEXT of that TRUNC later makes the access
    ;   sign-extending instead. A word TRUNC of a 64-bit LOAD is already a
    ;   free view (and the wide access can pair), so that LOAD is narrowed
